  "plot": "Brian Flanagan, an ambitious ex-military man determined to become a successful millionaire, serves drinks at a New York City tavern while studying for his degree. In the meantime, he waits for his big break. And then, cynical Doug Coughlin entered the picture. Now, Brian is confident that the veteran bartender will soon make them famous and rich as a bartending duo, thanks to their chemistry and flamboyant tricks behind the bar. However, all good things must come to an end. As Brian tries to raise money in Jamaica to open his dream bar, a chance encounter with Jordan, a beautiful young waitress, sparks a whirlwind romance. But passion and heartbreak go hand in hand. After all, love is a delicate thing. And the question remains: Is Brian sure he wants a future with Jordan?",
